   "textLength": 461,
   "text": "The sixth beta of the Haiku OS is here, now with more choice of web browsers and a working hardware-accelerated hypervisor.\nHaiku OS beta 6 came out just a week after the project's 25th birthday. We have been trying it on several different machines around the Irish Sea wing of Vulture Towers, and enjoying the experience very much.\nThe release notes contain a lot of changes and some significant new",
   "counts": {
    "links": 3,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 3,
    "repeats": 3,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.11,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 455,
    "height": 248,
    "widthFraction": 0.83,
    "leftFraction": 0.08,
