  {
   "index": 15,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "section",
    "main",
    "article",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 741,
   "text": "If you are interested in a different flavor of Unix, this is probably not the OS you're looking for. On the other hand, if you want something fast, lightweight, which supports quite a lot of commodity hardware and runs well on old, low-end machines that would struggle to run any modern Linux, then take a look. We love its 1990s-style subtly 3D-shaded GUI, which we find a delightful and refreshing ",
